 my my  default okay when I go to an event I'm  not  I'm not handing up my business cards and  shaking hands and telling people here's  what I do go check out my website when I  get on an airplane  I'm not chatting with the person next to  me and and learning about them I keep to  myself for the most part and if I was in  a sales type of role that would hurt me  and I've had to discover that for my  business to be successful I had to lean  more towards the marketing and so I  create an environment where people want  to talk to me and where people want to  do business with me instead of me having  to go out and talk to them because if  that was how I built my business I  wouldn't be successful I'd be struggling  and so you have to understand what your  personality is and then design your  business around something that will  leverage your strengths just like  whatever skills you have you know if I  try to start a pizza making business it  would suck because I don't know anything  about pizza I don't know how to make  pizza I'm not a baker I don't know any  of that stuff so it would suck but if I  did something more towards my skills I'd  have a much higher degree of success and  so just like when you're thinking about  businesses start when you're thinking  about how you're going to market and how  you're going to be successful you want  to design the task that you're working  on around your personality that fits you  because I guarantee you if you are going  out thinking that I have to have I have  to have a solid team of mentors and I  have to have a big social network for me  to be successful that's your mindset and  you're not that kind of person to go out  and do it then you're not going to be  successful other people will go out and  do that and the people who you might see  on TV who are you know they like being  on camera and who are those type-a  personalities those people they're good  at those things and so they leverage  them but they suck at other stuff 